      "content": "Confirmed.\n\nWhy this pipeline\n\u2022 like same whrere\n\nWhat each step does\n1. Bank_Statement_May \u2014 Reads working file Bank_Statement_May.csv and detects its columns.\n2. GL_Cash_Export \u2014 Reads working file GL_Cash_Export.xlsx and detects its columns.\n3. Treasury_Recon_SOP \u2014 Reads the policy/reference file Treasury_Recon_SOP.pdf and keeps the rules for matching and review.\n4. Matcher \u2014 Pairs rows that share amount, reference_number. Dates may drift by 2 day(s). Leftovers and splits go to exceptions.\n5. Math \u2014 Applies: 20 percent.\n6. Decision \u2014 Flags or approves using: Exceptions are sent for manual review by team members..\n7. Output \u2014 Builds a Excel report you can download.\n\nNext: Save this to the Super Agents library. You run it from the library with files that use the same names (values can change).",
